  dialogueBubbles:
  - snippets:
    - Oh, I was a beggar.
    - I used to be wealthy though...
  - snippets:
    - I can read and write.
    - 'So I made my living by reading letters outloud to the illiterate. '
    - I knew every hieroglyph!
  - snippets:
    - One day, the pharaoh made education mandatory! I had no more customers!
    - I lost my job and my wife divorced me!
    - I had to go to the streets and starved to death!
  - snippets:
    - I thought I was irreplacable.
    - I died because of my arrogance.
    - I would do any job for money!
